@startuml
actor Lecturer
boundary EditQuizPage
control QuizController
control QuizService
database Database

Lecturer -> EditQuizPage: Access quiz editing interface
EditQuizPage -> QuizController: GET /api/quizzes/{quizId} to retrieve quiz details
QuizController -> QuizService: Fetch quiz details
QuizService -> Database: Retrieve quiz details
Database --> QuizService: Return quiz details
QuizService --> QuizController: Return quiz details
QuizController --> EditQuizPage: Provide quiz details for editing

Lecturer -> EditQuizPage: Modify question text, options, categories, and points
EditQuizPage -> QuizController: POST /api/quizzes/{quizId}/update with updated question details
QuizController -> QuizService: Validate and process update
QuizService -> QuizService: Validate updated question data
alt Data is valid
    QuizService -> Database: Update quiz details
    Database --> QuizService: Return update status
    alt Update succeeded
        QuizService --> QuizController: Confirm update success
        QuizController --> EditQuizPage: Notify success
        EditQuizPage -> Lecturer: Display success message
    else Update failed
        QuizService --> QuizController: Notify failure
        QuizController --> EditQuizPage: Display error message
        EditQuizPage -> Lecturer: Display error message
    end
else Data is invalid
    QuizService --> QuizController: Return validation errors
    QuizController --> EditQuizPage: Display validation errors
    EditQuizPage -> Lecturer: Display validation errors
end

Lecturer -> EditQuizPage: Save or discard changes
alt Save changes
    EditQuizPage -> QuizController: Confirm save
    QuizController -> QuizService: Persist updated quiz details
    QuizService -> Database: Save updated quiz details
    Database --> QuizService: Return save confirmation
    QuizService --> QuizController: Confirm changes saved
    QuizController --> EditQuizPage: Notify changes saved
    EditQuizPage -> Lecturer: Display changes saved confirmation
else Discard changes
    EditQuizPage -> Lecturer: Discard edits and return to quiz list
end

@enduml
